     "text": "```json\n{\"count\": 2, \"rationale\": \"crown:obtain is an OR of h3_0:traverse and h3_1:obtain, so both must be made unreachable. No single block works. Blocking h3_1 leaves h3_0 reachable, since both of its parents, h2_2 and h1_1, are reachable. Blocking h3_0 leaves h3_1 reachable. Blocking h1_1 leaves h2_2 reachable via edge1, which makes h3_1 reachable. Blocking h2_2 leaves h1_1 reachable via edge1, which makes h3_1 reachable. Blocking any other step does not affect h2_2 or h1_1, so h3_1 stays reachable. Blocking h3_0 and h3_1 (or h1_1 and h2_2) makes the target unreachable, so the minimum is 2.\"}\n```"
